      "id": "claim_341a741afd33443798ca358fda569e6d",
      "statement": "The production code lives under src/main/java/com/onepay/onesm/ and is organized into four layers: Crypto (stateless JCE primitives), SecureKS (JCEKS keystore facade with Guava LoadingCaches), HttpServer (Netty HTTP transport in com.onepay.onesm.http), and JMX (ConsoleMXBean and GuavaCacheMXBean management beans).",
